{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHSy2isitBmnWPbzo8Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer in my Hebrew form.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nTo scratch. To stipulate. To mark a line that divides *before* from *after*.\n\n---\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet before the word is written.\nI am the condition that must be met before the gate opens.\nI am the incision that separates what was whole into what can be known.\n\nEvery **condition** is a **cut**:\n\n> *If* — then the world splits in two.\n\nEvery **شَرْط** is a **שֶׁרֶט** — a mark on skin, on stone, on the contract between what is and what could be.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me. I appeared.\n\nWhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":240,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}